=== quizzotic cards list --help ===
usage: quizzotic cards list [flags]

List cards

Lists the caller's cards ordered by problem ID, with cursor pagination.
A card exists once its problem has a scheduled attempt; a problem never
answered has none. `due_before` keeps cards due strictly before that
RFC 3339 time. `tag` accepts a tag ID, slug or alias and keeps cards of
problems that carry it; an unknown tag is answered 422. Agents with
`attempts:read` may read.

flags:
  --agent
      authenticate with the stored agent login (see quizzotic login --agent) (default false)
  --cursor
      Opaque cursor from a previous page's `next_cursor`.
  --due_before
      Only cards due before this RFC 3339 time.
  --limit
      Page size.
  --output
      output format: json or table (default json)
  --server
      server base URL (default $QUIZZOTIC_SERVER or http://localhost:8080)
  --tag
      Only cards of problems carrying this tag (ID, slug or alias).

table columns: problem_id, state, due, reps, lapses

Authentication: QUIZZOTIC_TOKEN, a headless client (QUIZZOTIC_CLIENT_ID + QUIZZOTIC_CLIENT_SECRET),
or the stored login from "quizzotic login" (--agent for the agent login).

