=== quizzotic problems archive --help ===
usage: quizzotic problems archive <id> [flags]

Archive a problem

Moves a `live` problem to `archived`, so it leaves review. Any other
status is 409 (a draft is discarded by deleting it; `archived` is
terminal). Requires `If-Match` (412 when stale, 428 when missing).

