=== quizzotic problems similar --help ===
usage: quizzotic problems similar [flags]

Find similar problems

Duplicate check. Tokenizes the given prompt and answers (lowercase
words and numbers) and ranks the caller's non-deleted problems by
token-set Jaccard similarity against each problem's current prompt and
answers (choice texts, accepted cloze answers, or the open reference
answer). Scores run from 0 to 1; problems sharing no token are never
returned. Results are ordered by score, highest first. This is a
read-only query.

flags:
  --agent
      authenticate with the stored agent login (see quizzotic login --agent) (default false)
  --data
      request body: @file.json, or - for stdin
  --output
      output format: json or table (default json)
  --server
      server base URL (default $QUIZZOTIC_SERVER or http://localhost:8080)
  --set
      set a body field: key=value (repeatable; dotted keys nest; values parse as JSON when valid)

table columns: score, id, type, prompt

Authentication: QUIZZOTIC_TOKEN, a headless client (QUIZZOTIC_CLIENT_ID + QUIZZOTIC_CLIENT_SECRET),
or the stored login from "quizzotic login" (--agent for the agent login).

