=== quizzotic quizzes create --help ===
usage: quizzotic quizzes create [flags]

Create a quiz

Creates a quiz, `draft` unless `status` says otherwise. `problem_ids`
optionally sets the initial items in order; each must be a distinct,
non-deleted problem of the caller (422 otherwise).

flags:
