=== quizzotic sessions complete --help ===
usage: quizzotic sessions complete <id> [flags]

Complete a session

Marks the session completed. Unanswered items are left unanswered; no
card changes. Completing a completed session returns it unchanged.
Humans only.

arguments:
  <id>  Session ID.

flags:
  --agent
      authenticate with the stored agent login (see quizzotic login --agent) (default false)
  --idempotency-key
      Client-chosen key; replays within 24 h return the original response. [sent as the Idempotency-Key header]
  --output
      output format: json or table (default json)
  --server
      server base URL (default $QUIZZOTIC_SERVER or http://localhost:8080)

