=== quizzotic tags set-tags --help ===
usage: quizzotic tags set-tags <id> [flags]

Replace a problem's tags

Replaces the set of tags on a problem. Each entry is a tag ID, slug or
alias; duplicates are ignored. A merged tag resolves to the tag it was
merged into. Unknown or retired tags are a 422. Tags attach to the
problem, not to a version.

arguments:
  <id>  Problem ID.

flags:
  --agent
      authenticate with the stored agent login (see quizzotic login --agent) (default false)
  --data
      request body: @file.json, or - for stdin
  --output
      output format: json or table (default json)
  --server
      server base URL (default $QUIZZOTIC_SERVER or http://localhost:8080)
  --set
      set a body field: key=value (repeatable; dotted keys nest; values parse as JSON when valid)

