or the stored login from "quizzotic login" (--agent for the agent login).

=== quizzotic tags update --help ===
usage: quizzotic tags update <tag> [flags]

Update a tag

Changes the name, description and/or slug. Changing the slug is a
rename: the old slug becomes an alias of the tag, so it keeps
resolving. Requires `If-Match` (412 when stale, 428 when missing).

arguments:
  <tag>  A tag ID, slug or alias.

flags:
